## Requirements

- [uv](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/) — dependency management
- [Docker](https://docs.docker.com/get-docker/) *(optional)* — containerised runs
- [DVC](https://dvc.org/) *(optional)* — data and pipeline versioning (installed as dev dependency)
- [graphify](https://github.com/Graphify-Labs/graphify) *(optional)* — codebase knowledge graph for AI assistants (auto-installed by `setup.sh`, best-effort)
- [rtk](https://github.com/rtk-ai/rtk) *(optional)* — filters/compresses command output before it reaches an agent's context (auto-installed by `setup.sh`, best-effort)

---

## Quick start

```bash
bash scripts/setup.sh
source .venv/bin/activate
```

`setup.sh` will: install uv if missing, sync dependencies, install pre-commit hooks, initialise DVC, create `.env` from `.env.example`, and best-effort install `graphify` and `rtk` (warns and continues if either fails -- they're conveniences, not hard requirements).

