## Commands

### Environment

| Command | Description |
|---|---|
| `make setup` | Bootstrap a fresh clone — installs uv, deps, pre-commit hooks, initialises DVC, creates `.env`, best-effort installs `graphify`/`rtk` |
| `make install` | Install dependencies and pre-commit hooks (assumes uv is already installed) |

### Code quality

| Command | Description |
|---|---|
| `make test` | Run tests with coverage report |
| `make test-fast` | Run tests without coverage |
| `make lint` | Lint with Ruff |
| `make typecheck` | Type-check with ty |
| `make format` | Format with Ruff |
| `make fix` | Lint, auto-fix, and format in one step |
| `make pre-commit` | Run all pre-commit hooks on every file |

### Docs

| Command | Description |
|---|---|
| `make docs` | Generate HTML docs into `docs/build/` using pdoc |
| `make docs-serve` | Serve docs locally with live reload |

### DVC

| Command | Description |
|---|---|
| `make dvc-pull` | Pull data and artifacts from the DVC remote |
| `make dvc-push` | Push data and artifacts to the DVC remote |
| `make dvc-repro` | Reproduce the full DVC pipeline |

Run a single stage or check status directly:

```bash
uv run dvc repro <stage_name>
uv run dvc status
```

### Docker

| Command | Description |
|---|---|
| `make docker-build` | Build the Docker image |
| `make docker-up` | Start services in detached mode |
| `make docker-down` | Stop and remove containers |

### Cleanup

| Command | Description |
|---|---|
| `make clean` | Remove build artifacts, caches, and compiled files |

